@host = http://localhost:3000/api/v1

### 1. List restaurants — 200
GET {{host}}/restaurants

### 2. Old unversioned route must be 404
GET http://localhost:3000/api/restaurants

### Filter restaurants using query string
GET {{host}}/restaurants?isOpen=true&area=Bole,Piassa

### Sparse fields — smaller restaurant response
GET {{host}}/restaurants?fields=id,name,area

### Descending restaurant sort
GET {{host}}/restaurants?sort=-name

### Restaurant member
GET {{host}}/restaurants/1

### Create restaurant — 201 + Location
POST {{host}}/restaurants
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Sishu",
  "area": "Kazanchis"
}

### Nested restaurant dishes
GET {{host}}/restaurants/1/dishes

### List dishes with paging and sort
GET {{host}}/dishes?limit=5&offset=0&sort=-priceSantim

### List orders
GET {{host}}/orders

### Status filter, comma-separated values
GET {{host}}/orders?status=pending,preparing

### Descending total sort
GET {{host}}/orders?sort=-totalSantim

### Sparse order fields
GET {{host}}/orders?fields=id,customer,status,totalSantim

### Pending orders are now a query filter, not a route
GET {{host}}/orders?status=pending

### Get one order
GET {{host}}/orders/1

### Create order — 201 + Location
POST {{host}}/orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "customer": "Beza Hayalu",
  "area": "Bole",
  "restaurantId": 1,
  "totalSantim": 45000
}

### Update only the order status
PATCH {{host}}/orders/2/status
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "preparing"
}

### Delete order — 204
DELETE {{host}}/orders/1

### Delete same order again — 204 again (idempotent)
DELETE {{host}}/orders/1

### Orders belonging to restaurant 1
GET {{host}}/restaurants/1/orders?status=pending,preparing

### Invalid sort field — 400
GET {{host}}/orders?sort=-unknownField
